--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Apache License above covers the source code in this repository only.

This pipeline processes third-party RF datasets that are NOT distributed
with this source code and that carry their own, separate licenses. Those
licenses are unaffected by the Apache License and continue to govern any
dataset artifact this pipeline produces from them.

The authoritative per-dataset license record is the LICENSE constant in
each datasets/<name>/config.py. At the time of writing:

  sub_ghz                               CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
  lte_wifi_dvbt                         CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
  rml2016_10a                           CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
  rml2018_01a                           CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
  radchar                               CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
  its_band                              CC-BY-4.0
  nist_wifi_bluetooth                   NIST-public-domain (NIST data terms)

Aggregated artifacts inherit the most restrictive license present among
their inputs. Every generated artifact ships a *.croissant.json sidecar
carrying its license and the canonical citation for its source dataset.
Users redistributing generated datasets must comply with those terms and
attribute the original dataset authors.

See release_templates/LICENSES.md for the per-file breakdown shipped with
release bundles.
